\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 SPEC-1-Terms & Policies Reviewer\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\fs36 \cf0 Background\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Modern Terms of Service (ToS) and Privacy Policies are long, frequently updated, and written in ways that make it hard for non-lawyers to spot risk. Users want fast, reliable insight into where their rights may be limited (e.g., mandatory arbitration, class-action waivers, unilateral change clauses) and how their data is collected, shared, retained, and monetized. Privacy regulations (e.g., GDPR, CCPA/CPRA) add jurisdiction-specific obligations that are easy to miss, especially when policies are split across ToS, Privacy, Cookies, and supplemental notices.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf0 Problem to solve:
\f1\b0  Provide an automated reviewer that ingests policy documents (URLs, PDFs, pasted text), extracts key clauses, flags potentially rights-infringing or high-risk language, maps findings to relevant jurisdictions/regulatory themes, and explains implications in plain language accompanied by citations to the exact passages.\

\f0\b Primary stakeholders:
\f1\b0  Individual consumers, SMB founders and product leads, privacy champions in startups, digital rights advocates, and procurement reviewers who must vet third\uc0\u8209 party services quickly.\

\f0\b Document scope:
\f1\b0  ToS, Privacy Policy, Cookie Policy, EULA, Data Processing Addendum (DPA), and in-app notices. Version diffs between policy revisions are in scope to surface newly introduced risks.\

\f0\b Non-goals:
\f1\b0  This tool does not dispense legal advice or replace counsel; instead it accelerates triage and due diligence by highlighting issues and providing traceable evidence.\

\f0\b Key challenges:
\f1\b0  Highly variable formats and legal phrasing; cross-references across multiple docs; geo-specific rules; evolving definitions (e.g., \'93sale\'94 of data); dynamic website content; and multilingual policies.\

\f0\b Indicators of success:
\f1\b0  High precision/recall on risky-clause detection; reduced time-to-insight; user-rated clarity of explanations; and accurate, per\uc0\u8209 jurisdiction tagging of findings.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

