\fs24 \cf0 Must Have
\f1\b0 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Multi-source ingestion
\f1\b0 : URLs, PDFs (incl. scanned via OCR), and pasted text up to ~500k chars per doc; bundle multiple docs for the same service (ToS, Privacy, Cookies, DPA, EULA). Supports comparing multiple apps side-by-side.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Structure-aware extraction
\f1\b0 : Preserve headings, lists, tables, page numbers/anchors; de-duplicate boilerplate; normalize cross\uc0\u8209 refs.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Risk taxonomy & detection
\f1\b0 : Hybrid rules + ML to detect rights-impacting and privacy/AI risks. Initial taxonomy includes: arbitration/class\uc0\u8209 action waivers, unilateral change, governing law/jurisdiction, indemnity, warranty/limitation of liability, IP/content license & assignment, auto\u8209 renewal/cancellation, termination, moderation/monitoring, data categories collected/derived, data for model training, AI outputs ownership, profiling/automated decision\u8209 making, biometrics/sensitive data, children\'92s data, data sale/share/targeted ads, cross\u8209 border transfers, retention/deletion, sub\u8209 processors/third\u8209 party sharing, opt\u8209 out/objection rights, Do Not Sell/Share, cookie tracking/consent.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Jurisdiction tagging
\f1\b0 : Map each finding to applicable regimes: US (federal + state), EU (GDPR + ePrivacy themes), UK GDPR/DPDPA, EU AI Act themes, and a generic "Other AI regimes" tag. English analysis in v1.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Evidence & explainability
\f1\b0 : For every flag, show plain\uc0\u8209 language rationale, severity (High/Med/Low), confidence score, and exact quoted snippet with source anchors.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Policy version diff
\f1\b0 : Highlight newly added/removed/changed clauses across policy revisions; compute risk delta.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Interactive dashboard reports
\f1\b0 : Aggregated dimensions & metrics across ToS/Privacy/AI themes; filter by vendor, date, risk class, jurisdiction, clause type; drill-down to snippets; export to CSV/PDF.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Watchlists & alerts
\f1\b0 : Track vendors; notify on policy changes and risk score shifts.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Automatic policy discovery
\f1\b0 : Crawl from a root domain to find ToS/Privacy/Cookies/AI policy pages.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 API access
\f1\b0 : CI/CD and procurement integrations; bulk analyses; OAuth/API keys.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Non-English policies translated to English
\f1\b0 : Quality-gated machine translation with disclosure; citations retain links to original-language anchors.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Workspace & sharing
\f1\b0 : Team workspaces with RBAC (viewer/editor/admin); export reports as PDF and JSON with persistent share links; non\uc0\u8209 legal\u8209 advice disclaimer.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Privacy & security baseline
\f1\b0 : Ephemeral processing by default; optional encrypted-at-rest workspace storage with configurable retention up to 
\f0\b 1 year
\f1\b0  to support analytics; region-based residency (US/EU/UK); audit trail of analyses; data deletion controls; TLS in transit.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Accessibility & usability
\f1\b0 : WCAG 2.1 AA compliance; keyboard navigation; readable risk summaries.\
