\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 Non\uc0\u8209 Functional Requirements (NFRs)\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls5\ilvl0
\fs24 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Accuracy targets
\f1\b0 : For High\uc0\u8209 risk classes, \u8805 0.85 precision and \u8805 0.80 recall; false\u8209 positive rate \u8804 10%.\
\ls5\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Performance
\f1\b0 : Parse and analyze large docs efficiently; horizontal scaling for concurrent jobs; streaming progress.\
\ls5\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Deployment/Hosting
\f1\b0 : SaaS multi-tenant for v1; optional enterprise single-tenant later.\
\ls5\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Security
\f1\b0 : Encryption at rest, key management in KMS/HSM; SSO/SAML/OIDC; role\uc0\u8209 based access; least\u8209 privilege; secrets in vault; regular penetration tests.\
\ls5\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Privacy
\f1\b0 : No training on customer documents unless explicit opt\uc0\u8209 in; region-based data residency (US/EU/UK) when storage is enabled; optional workspace storage with retention up to 
\f0\b 1 year
\f1\b0  by default (configurable per workspace); user-controlled deletion; redaction utilities.\
\ls5\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Observability
\f1\b0 : Metrics, logs, traces; per\uc0\u8209 tenant quotas; rate limits; audit logs export.\
\ls5\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Availability
\f1\b0 : Highly available stateless workers; graceful retries; idempotent pipelines.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 Method\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\fs28 \cf0 Architecture Overview\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls6\ilvl0
\fs24 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Event-driven pipeline
\f1\b0  with async workers orchestrated by a message queue; stateless services; object storage for raw artifacts; relational DB for metadata; search index for clause/snippet retrieval.\
\ls6\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Bounded AI Agents
\f1\b0  (task-specific services with guardrails): (1) 
\f2\i Policy Discovery Agent
\f1\i0  (find ToS/Privacy/Cookies/AI pages from a root domain), (2) 
\f2\i Change Detection Agent
\f1\i0  (monitor & diff versions), (3) 
\f2\i Comparison Agent
\f1\i0  (assemble cross\uc0\u8209 vendor reports), (4) 
\f2\i Alerting Agent
\f1\i0  (watchlists & notifications). Agents operate under strict scopes, rate limits, and robots.txt awareness.\
\ls6\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 LLM/NLP hybrid
\f1\b0 : deterministic 
\f0\b rules
\f1\b0  + 
\f0\b transformer classifiers
\f1\b0  for detection; 
\f0\b LLM
\f1\b0  used for explanation and borderline classifications 
\f0\b only after
\f1\b0  passing a 
\f0\b topic/theme gating filter
\f1\b0  (rules/transformers) and 
\f0\b redaction
\f1\b0 . No training on customer data; data isolation per workspace.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

