\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 Core Algorithms (concise)\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls7\ilvl0
\fs24 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Clause Extraction
\f1\b0 : HTML/PDF parsed \uc0\u8594  DOM tree & layout blocks \u8594  heading detection (regex + font/spacing heuristics) \u8594  section numbering \u8594  clause spans with path anchors.\
\ls7\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Detection Pipeline
\f1\b0 : For each clause: apply rule packs (regex + token patterns); if inconclusive, run transformer multi\uc0\u8209 label classifier; only if still borderline, send 
\f0\b minimal snippet
\f1\b0  (\uc0\u8804 1\'963 clauses) through 
\f0\b Gating Filter
\f1\b0  \uc0\u8594  
\f0\b LLM Explainer
\f1\b0  to produce plain\uc0\u8209 language rationale and severity suggestion; combine via calibrated ensemble.\
\ls7\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Version Diff
\f1\b0 : Map clauses across versions using heading/anchor keys + MinHash of text; compute added/removed/changed; weight changes by risk class for alerting.\
\ls7\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Risk Scoring
\f1\b0 : Weighted sum of findings per theme with jurisdiction multipliers and confidence weighting; normalize to 0\'96100; compute vendor-level scores by doc-type aggregation.\
\ls7\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Watchlists & Alerts
\f1\b0 : Triggers when (a) risk delta exceeds threshold, (b) new high\uc0\u8209 risk taxonomy appears, (c) specific vendor rules; de-duplicate and batch notifications.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

